{"seq":4,"slug":"execution-model","title":"执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/core-concepts/execution-model","wordCount":1188,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"执行模型\">执行模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WASM 模块从字节到可运行实例，要经过<strong>解码 → 验证 → 编译 → 链接</strong>四个阶段；配合 Streaming API，下载与编译可以并行进行。执行时，WASM 拥有独立于 JS 的<strong>调用栈</strong>，每个调用帧携带局部变量、操作数栈与返回地址。运行期出现的不可恢复错误（内存越界、除零、类型不匹配等）以 <strong>trap</strong> 形式终止执行，在 JS 侧表现为 <code>RuntimeError</code>。除 NaN 位模式外，WASM 保证<strong>确定性执行</strong>——“相同输入、相同输出”是其可复现性的基础。这一切都建立在一个<strong>沙箱模型</strong>之上：代码只能访问线性内存和宿主显式提供的导入。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实例化过程\">实例化过程</h2><p>WASM 模块从加载到执行需要经历解码、验证、编译和实例化四个阶段。实例化是将静态模块变为可执行实例的关键步骤。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App as 应用层&#10;    participant Engine as WASM 引擎&#10;    participant Module as 模块&#10;    participant Instance as 实例&#10;&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Engine: fetch(&quot;module.wasm&quot;)&#10;    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 解码二进制格式&#10;    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 类型验证&#10;    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 编译(基线/优化)&#10;    Engine-&gt;&gt;Module: 创建 Module 对象&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Engine: instantiate(module, imports)&#10;    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 链接导入&#10;    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 初始化内存/表/全局&#10;    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 执行 start 函数&#10;    Engine-&gt;&gt;Instance: 返回 Instance 对象&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Instance: 调用导出函数\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as 应用层\n    participant Engine as WASM 引擎\n    participant Module as 模块\n    participant Instance as 实例\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;Engine: fetch(\"module.wasm\")\n    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 解码二进制格式\n    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 类型验证\n    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 编译(基线/优化)\n    Engine-&gt;&gt;Module: 创建 Module 对象\n    App-&gt;&gt;Engine: instantiate(module, imports)\n    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 链接导入\n    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 初始化内存/表/全局\n    Engine-&gt;&gt;Engine: 执行 start 函数\n    Engine-&gt;&gt;Instance: 返回 Instance 对象\n    App-&gt;&gt;Instance: 调用导出函数</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const response = await fetch(&#39;compute.wasm&#39;);&#10;const module = await WebAssembly.compileStreaming(response);&#10;&#10;const importObject = {&#10;  env: {&#10;    log: (value: number) =&gt; console.log(value),&#10;    memory: new WebAssembly.Memory({ initial: 1 }),&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;const instance = await WebAssembly.instantiate(module, importObject);&#10;const result = instance.exports.compute(42);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'compute.wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> module</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compileStreaming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> importObject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  env: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    memory: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ initial: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> instance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">instantiate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, importObject);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance.exports.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>可能的错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解码</td>\n<td>字节流</td>\n<td>段结构</td>\n<td>格式错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证</td>\n<td>段结构</td>\n<td>已验证模块</td>\n<td>CompileError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译</td>\n<td>已验证模块</td>\n<td>机器码</td>\n<td>编译器内部错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实例化</td>\n<td>Module + Imports</td>\n<td>Instance</td>\n<td>LinkError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行</td>\n<td>函数调用</td>\n<td>返回值</td>\n<td>RuntimeError</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>WebAssembly.compileStreaming</code> 和 <code>WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming</code> 可以在下载的同时编译模块，比先 <code>fetch</code> 再 <code>compile</code> 的方式快得多。始终优先使用 Streaming 版本。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"调用栈管理\">调用栈管理</h2><p>WASM 的调用栈与 JavaScript 调用栈是分离的。每次函数调用会在 WASM 栈上创建一个新的<strong>调用帧（Call Frame）</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph WASM 调用栈&#10;        FRAME3[帧 3: factorial(1)&lt;br/&gt;locals: [n=1]&lt;br/&gt;stack: [1]&quot;]&#10;        FRAME2[帧 2: factorial(2)&lt;br/&gt;locals: [n=2]&lt;br/&gt;stack: [等待]&quot;]&#10;        FRAME1[帧 1: factorial(3)&lt;br/&gt;locals: [n=3]&lt;br/&gt;stack: [等待]&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph JS 调用栈&#10;        JSFRAME[&quot;JS: instance.exports.factorial(3)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    JSFRAME --&gt; FRAME1\">graph TD\n    subgraph WASM 调用栈\n        FRAME3[帧 3: factorial(1)&lt;br/&gt;locals: [n=1]&lt;br/&gt;stack: [1]\"]\n        FRAME2[帧 2: factorial(2)&lt;br/&gt;locals: [n=2]&lt;br/&gt;stack: [等待]\"]\n        FRAME1[帧 1: factorial(3)&lt;br/&gt;locals: [n=3]&lt;br/&gt;stack: [等待]\"]\n    end\n    subgraph JS 调用栈\n        JSFRAME[\"JS: instance.exports.factorial(3)\"]\n    end\n    JSFRAME --&gt; FRAME1</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调用帧组成</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>局部变量</td>\n<td>参数 + 函数内声明的 local</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作数栈</td>\n<td>当前指令序列的计算栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回地址</td>\n<td>调用方的继续执行点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数索引</td>\n<td>当前执行的函数标识</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wat\" data-code=\"(module&#10;  (func $factorial (param $n i32) (result i32)&#10;    (if (result i32) (i32.le_s (local.get $n) (i32.const 1))&#10;      (then (i32.const 1))&#10;      (else&#10;        (i32.mul&#10;          (local.get $n)&#10;          (call $factorial&#10;            (i32.sub (local.get $n) (i32.const 1))&#10;          )&#10;        )&#10;      )&#10;    )&#10;  )&#10;  (export &quot;factorial&quot; (func $factorial))&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (func $factorial (param $n i32) (result i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (if (result i32) (i32.le_s (local.get $n) (i32.const 1))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (then (i32.const 1))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (i32.mul</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          (local.get $n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          (call $factorial</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            (i32.sub (local.get $n) (i32.const 1))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (export \"factorial\" (func $factorial))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn factorial(n: u32) -&gt; u64 {&#10;    (1..=n as u64).product()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn factorial(n: u32) -> u64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (1..=n as u64).product()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> WASM 规范没有定义调用栈的大小限制，这取决于具体引擎实现。V8 通常允许约 10000 层递归，但生产代码应该避免深递归，改用循环实现。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"trap-处理\">Trap 处理</h2><p>Trap 是 WASM 的运行时错误机制。当发生不可恢复的错误时，执行立即终止并向宿主报告错误。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Trap 类型</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>对应 JS 异常</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存越界</td>\n<td>load/store 访问超出内存范围</td>\n<td>RuntimeError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整数除零</td>\n<td><code>i32.div_s</code> / <code>i32.div_u</code> 除数为 0</td>\n<td>RuntimeError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整数溢出</td>\n<td><code>i32.trunc_f64_s</code> 结果超出范围</td>\n<td>RuntimeError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间接调用类型不匹配</td>\n<td><code>call_indirect</code> 签名不匹配</td>\n<td>RuntimeError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表索引越界</td>\n<td>函数表访问超出范围</td>\n<td>RuntimeError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unreachable</code> 指令</td>\n<td>执行到不可达代码标记</td>\n<td>RuntimeError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈溢出</td>\n<td>调用栈超出引擎限制</td>\n<td>RangeError（引擎特定）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"try {&#10;  instance.exports.riskyFunction();&#10;} catch (error) {&#10;  if (error instanceof WebAssembly.RuntimeError) {&#10;    console.error(&#39;WASM trap:&#39;, error.message);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instance.exports.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">riskyFunction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">instanceof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WebAssembly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RuntimeError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WASM trap:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, error.message);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    EXEC[&quot;正常执行&quot;] --&gt;|内存越界| TRAP[&quot;Trap!&quot;]&#10;    EXEC --&gt;|除零| TRAP&#10;    EXEC --&gt;|类型不匹配| TRAP&#10;    TRAP --&gt; UNWIND[&quot;展开 WASM 调用栈&quot;]&#10;    UNWIND --&gt; JSERROR[&quot;抛出 RuntimeError 到 JS&quot;]&#10;    JSERROR --&gt; CATCH[&quot;JS try/catch 捕获&quot;]&#10;    JSERROR --&gt; UNCAUGHT[&quot;未捕获 → 程序终止&quot;]\">graph TD\n    EXEC[\"正常执行\"] --&gt;|内存越界| TRAP[\"Trap!\"]\n    EXEC --&gt;|除零| TRAP\n    EXEC --&gt;|类型不匹配| TRAP\n    TRAP --&gt; UNWIND[\"展开 WASM 调用栈\"]\n    UNWIND --&gt; JSERROR[\"抛出 RuntimeError 到 JS\"]\n    JSERROR --&gt; CATCH[\"JS try/catch 捕获\"]\n    JSERROR --&gt; UNCAUGHT[\"未捕获 → 程序终止\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn safe_access(data: &amp;[u8], index: usize) -&gt; Result&lt;u8, JsValue&gt; {&#10;    data.get(index)&#10;        .copied()&#10;        .ok_or_else(|| JsValue::from_str(&quot;Index out of bounds&quot;))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn safe_access(data: &#x26;[u8], index: usize) -> Result&#x3C;u8, JsValue> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.get(index)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .copied()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .ok_or_else(|| JsValue::from_str(\"Index out of bounds\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Trap 会立即终止整个 WASM 调用链。如果你需要错误恢复而不是终止，应该在 Rust 侧使用 <code>Result</code> 类型，将错误作为返回值传递给 JS，而不是让 panic 变成 trap。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"确定性执行\">确定性执行</h2><p>WASM 的一个重要设计目标是<strong>确定性</strong>——相同的输入在任何平台上都应该产生相同的输出。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>确定性维度</th>\n<th>WASM 保证</th>\n<th>例外情况</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整数运算</td>\n<td>完全确定</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮点运算</td>\n<td>遵循 IEEE 754</td>\n<td>NaN 的位模式不确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存操作</td>\n<td>确定性读写</td>\n<td>初始值为 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制流</td>\n<td>完全确定</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数调用顺序</td>\n<td>求值顺序确定</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源限制</td>\n<td>栈大小/内存限制</td>\n<td>取决于引擎实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"pub fn deterministic_compute(a: f64, b: f64) -&gt; f64 {&#10;    let sum = a + b;&#10;    let product = a * b;&#10;    (sum + product) / 2.0&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn deterministic_compute(a: f64, b: f64) -> f64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let sum = a + b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let product = a * b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (sum + product) / 2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    INPUT[&quot;相同输入&quot;] --&gt; ENGINE1[&quot;Chrome V8&quot;]&#10;    INPUT --&gt; ENGINE2[&quot;Firefox SpiderMonkey&quot;]&#10;    INPUT --&gt; ENGINE3[&quot;Wasmtime&quot;]&#10;    ENGINE1 --&gt; OUTPUT1[&quot;结果 A&quot;]&#10;    ENGINE2 --&gt; OUTPUT2[&quot;结果 A&quot;]&#10;    ENGINE3 --&gt; OUTPUT3[&quot;结果 A&quot;]&#10;    OUTPUT1 -.-&gt;|&quot;一致&quot;| SAME[&quot;确定性保证&quot;]&#10;    OUTPUT2 -.-&gt;|&quot;一致&quot;| SAME&#10;    OUTPUT3 -.-&gt;|&quot;一致&quot;| SAME\">graph LR\n    INPUT[\"相同输入\"] --&gt; ENGINE1[\"Chrome V8\"]\n    INPUT --&gt; ENGINE2[\"Firefox SpiderMonkey\"]\n    INPUT --&gt; ENGINE3[\"Wasmtime\"]\n    ENGINE1 --&gt; OUTPUT1[\"结果 A\"]\n    ENGINE2 --&gt; OUTPUT2[\"结果 A\"]\n    ENGINE3 --&gt; OUTPUT3[\"结果 A\"]\n    OUTPUT1 -.-&gt;|\"一致\"| SAME[\"确定性保证\"]\n    OUTPUT2 -.-&gt;|\"一致\"| SAME\n    OUTPUT3 -.-&gt;|\"一致\"| SAME</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> NaN 的位模式是 WASM 中唯一的非确定性来源。如果你的应用需要位级确定性（如区块链场景），需要使用 <code>f32.copysign</code> 等方式规范化 NaN 值。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"沙箱安全保证\">沙箱安全保证</h2><p>WASM 的沙箱模型确保模块只能访问被显式授予的资源，不能突破隔离边界。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 沙箱内部&#10;        CODE[&quot;WASM 代码&quot;]&#10;        MEM[&quot;线性内存&quot;]&#10;        TABLE[&quot;函数表&quot;]&#10;        GLOBAL[&quot;全局变量&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 沙箱外部&#10;        FS[&quot;文件系统&quot;]&#10;        NET[&quot;网络&quot;]&#10;        DOM[&quot;DOM&quot;]&#10;        OS[&quot;操作系统&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    CODE --&gt; MEM&#10;    CODE --&gt; TABLE&#10;    CODE --&gt; GLOBAL&#10;    CODE -.-&gt;|&quot;仅通过导入函数&quot;| FS&#10;    CODE -.-&gt;|&quot;仅通过导入函数&quot;| NET&#10;    CODE -.-&gt;|&quot;仅通过导入函数&quot;| DOM&#10;    CODE x-.-&gt;|&quot;不可直接访问&quot;| OS\">graph TD\n    subgraph 沙箱内部\n        CODE[\"WASM 代码\"]\n        MEM[\"线性内存\"]\n        TABLE[\"函数表\"]\n        GLOBAL[\"全局变量\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 沙箱外部\n        FS[\"文件系统\"]\n        NET[\"网络\"]\n        DOM[\"DOM\"]\n        OS[\"操作系统\"]\n    end\n    CODE --&gt; MEM\n    CODE --&gt; TABLE\n    CODE --&gt; GLOBAL\n    CODE -.-&gt;|\"仅通过导入函数\"| FS\n    CODE -.-&gt;|\"仅通过导入函数\"| NET\n    CODE -.-&gt;|\"仅通过导入函数\"| DOM\n    CODE x-.-&gt;|\"不可直接访问\"| OS</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全属性</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存隔离</td>\n<td>线性内存有明确边界，无法访问宿主内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无系统调用</td>\n<td>WASM 无内置 I/O，必须通过导入函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码完整性</td>\n<td>已验证代码不可被运行时修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能力受限</td>\n<td>只能使用宿主显式提供的导入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制流完整性</td>\n<td>无任意跳转，不可执行数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源限制</td>\n<td>内存/栈大小受宿主控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((执行模型))&#10;    实例化&#10;      解码/验证/编译&#10;      链接导入&#10;      start 函数&#10;    调用栈&#10;      独立于 JS 栈&#10;      调用帧结构&#10;      深度取决于引擎&#10;    Trap 处理&#10;      六种 trap 类型&#10;      立即终止执行&#10;      映射为 RuntimeError&#10;    确定性&#10;      相同输入相同输出&#10;      NaN 位模式例外&#10;      跨平台一致&#10;    沙箱安全&#10;      内存隔离&#10;      能力受限&#10;      无直接系统调用\">mindmap\n  root((执行模型))\n    实例化\n      解码/验证/编译\n      链接导入\n      start 函数\n    调用栈\n      独立于 JS 栈\n      调用帧结构\n      深度取决于引擎\n    Trap 处理\n      六种 trap 类型\n      立即终止执行\n      映射为 RuntimeError\n    确定性\n      相同输入相同输出\n      NaN 位模式例外\n      跨平台一致\n    沙箱安全\n      内存隔离\n      能力受限\n      无直接系统调用</pre><ul>\n<li>WASM 实例化经历<strong>解码→验证→编译→链接</strong>四阶段，优先使用 Streaming API 实现下载与编译并行。</li>\n<li>调用栈独立于 JS 栈，每个调用帧包含局部变量、操作数栈和返回地址。</li>\n<li>Trap 是不可恢复的运行时错误，包括内存越界、除零、类型不匹配等，在 JS 侧表现为 <code>RuntimeError</code>。</li>\n<li>WASM 保证<strong>确定性执行</strong>——除 NaN 位模式外，相同输入在任何引擎上产生相同输出。</li>\n<li><strong>沙箱模型</strong>确保 WASM 代码只能访问线性内存和宿主显式提供的导入，无法突破隔离边界。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"执行模型","id":"执行模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实例化过程","id":"实例化过程"},{"level":2,"text":"调用栈管理","id":"调用栈管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Trap 处理","id":"trap-处理"},{"level":2,"text":"确定性执行","id":"确定性执行"},{"level":2,"text":"沙箱安全保证","id":"沙箱安全保证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"二进制与文本格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/core-concepts/binary-and-text-format"},"next":{"title":"wasm-bindgen 绑定生成器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/rust-to-wasm/wasm-bindgen"}}